    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d687">

                <pb facs="1163" n="1149" sameAs="frus:frus1944v01/pg1149"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">840.48 Refugees/9–844: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Representative on the Advisory Council for
                        Italy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Kirk</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rome</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-09-08T16:00:00+02:00">September 8,
                            1944—4 p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received September 9—10:02 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>317. Department 114, August 30, 7 p.m. and my 302, September 4, 5 p.m.<anchor
                        n="94" xml:id="d687-f1"/> According to note dated September 8 from the Holy
                    See the approach to the German Government through Vatican channels by the Pope
                    requesting the release of about 9000 refugees in Northern Italy to be
                    transported to Southern Italy or elsewhere was made by the Nuncio in Berlin
                    (Taylor’s 309)<anchor n="95" xml:id="d687-f2"/> with the result that Germany
                    claimed that the authority for these persons rested with the Italian Socialist
                    Republic. The Vatican further indicated that they had no communication with that
                    body. Full text follows by air.<anchor n="96" xml:id="d687-f3"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Kirk</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d687-f1" n="94" xml:id="d687-f1-content">
                <p>Neither printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d687-f2" n="95" xml:id="d687-f2-content">
                <p>Reference is made to a communication of September 8 from Mr. Myron C. Taylor,
                    President Roosevelt’s Personal Representative to Pope Pius XII, conveying
                    information repeated herein.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d687-f3" n="96" xml:id="d687-f3-content">
                <p>Not printed.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
